OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_Spectator::
	.string "CISSY tells every challenger the\n"
	.string "same thing. Talk to the GYM GUIDE\l"
	.string "before you go up.\p"
	.string "They hear it, walk straight past\n"
	.string "him, and lose in the rain.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_Swimmer::
	.string "She swims the inlet most mornings\n"
	.string "and leaves the gym shut.\p"
	.string "Nobody minds. She has never lost\l"
	.string "a challenge she turned up for.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_Child::
	.string "The gym is full of water. All the\n"
	.string "way to the top!\p"
	.string "Mum says I can go in when I can\n"
	.string "swim it.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_Fisher::
	.string "Everyone watches the gym. Nobody\n"
	.string "watches the water.\p"
	.string "There is plenty in it.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_CissyMeet::
	.string "Hey! Were you looking for the\n"
	.string "gym? It's shut. That's my fault.\p"
	.string "I'm CISSY, MIKAN's LEADER. The\n"
	.string "water was too good to waste on\l"
	.string "sitting indoors.\p"
	.string "Before you challenge any of us,\n"
	.string "here's what you should know.\p"
	.string "The ORANGE CREW is four LEADERS\n"
	.string "and our champ, DRAKE. We've each\l"
	.string "got our own flavour, and we don't\l"
	.string "all play by the same rules the\l"
	.string "mainland LEADERS do.\p"
	.string "So talk to our GYM GUIDES. Every\n"
	.string "one of us has one, and they'll\l"
	.string "give you the scoop on how that\l"
	.string "gym rolls.\p"
	.string "Mine's just inside the door. Go\n"
	.string "on -- I'll dry off and meet you\l"
	.string "at the top of the pool.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_CissyWaiting::
	.string "Still down here? The pool's\n"
	.string "waiting, and so am I.\p"
	.string "Talk to my GYM GUIDE on the way\n"
	.string "in. That's what he's for.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_CissyBeaten::
	.string "One down. Three LEADERS and DRAKE\n"
	.string "to go.\p"
	.string "Try NAVEL next. DANNY runs his\n"
	.string "gym nothing like I run mine --\l"
	.string "ask his GYM GUIDE before you find\l"
	.string "that out the hard way.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_GymShut::
	.string "The door is shut.\p"
	.string "A card is wedged in the handle:\n"
	.string "GONE SWIMMING. -- C.$"
